== Overview ==
The '''Grim Reaper''' is an [[Enemies|Enemy]] that appears on wave 50 in the [[Halloween Graveyard]].  It is the first enemy to defeat a unit, not able to do anything unless you sell it and place it back. It was added in the[[Halloween Event 2024]].

== Appearance ==
It appears to be a skeleton in a long, black robe, holding a scythe looking like the [https://villains.fandom.com/wiki/Grim_Reaper_(folklore) Grim Reaper] you would regularly see.

== Abilities ==
When near a unit, it is possible the '''Grim Reaper''' can swing it's scythe, which can defeat the unit which will be permanently stunned.

== Strategy ==
If you reach this wave, it will not be that difficult to pass this since you have a lot of DPS in the field. However, you must have lots of money using a farm unit like [[Santa TV Man]] in case the '''Grim Reaper''' defeats your unit.

Use a unit that has stun blockings ([https://toilet-tower-defense-game.fandom.com/wiki/Upgraded_Large_Laser_Cameraman?so=search Upgraded Large Laser Cameraman] is recommended as this unit is unstunabble at max lvl) so your units will not be able to be defeated easily.

== Trivia ==

* this is the 2nd boss (so far) that isn't a toilet or similar objects. The first is [[Evil Toilet Crab]]

